            "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/520692c3fbb9d7b4b645d6d776f60500.poster.avif?t=1684347717\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/520692c3fbb9d7b4b645d6d776f60500.webm?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/520692c3fbb9d7b4b645d6d776f60500.mp4?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Skydome</strong> is a multiplayer Tower Defense game that combines action, strategy, and PvE and PvP elements. Alongside your team of four Champions, each with unique abilities, build mazes of walls and towers to stop the invading troops and protect your Artifact. But there's more. As the battle rages on, unravel the Jungle to fortify your own troops and break through the opponents defenses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAIN FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique gameplay:</strong> Skydome brings together the best of Tower Defense and multiplayer games, challenging your strategy, coordination, and teamwork<br></li><li><strong>Defense is the best offense:</strong> protect your Artifact with 4 different towers and an exclusive one to each Champion<br></li><li><strong>Play Tower Defense your way:</strong> discover your favorite playstyle by choosing from more than 10 amazing characters<br></li><li><strong>Kings of the Jungle:</strong> explore the lanes surroundings and fight fantastic creatures to obtain advantages that will lead your team to victory<br></li><li><strong>Surprise the opponent:</strong> disrupt the opposing team's defenses with powerful Intervention skills</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/e76f95a80a08cbb85103b24898f680a2.poster.avif?t=1684347717\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/e76f95a80a08cbb85103b24898f680a2.webm?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/e76f95a80a08cbb85103b24898f680a2.mp4?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR BATTLEFIELD</h2><br>Build your maze considering your Champion's strengths and the chosen map. The possibilities are endless, and it's up to your team to find the best construction strategy for each situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/60f10adc8b44d136b640a2a963fde785.poster.avif?t=1684347717\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/60f10adc8b44d136b640a2a963fde785.webm?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/60f10adc8b44d136b640a2a963fde785.mp4?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIRE POWER</h2><br>You'll need all the help you can get to face the dangerous threats of the Skydome arena. Build towers that slow down enemy troops, inflict area damage, continuous damage, and ranged damage to exterminate everything that threatens your Artifact.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/dac269451d8a4e65032c7b10b9ebbd34.poster.avif?t=1684347717\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/dac269451d8a4e65032c7b10b9ebbd34.webm?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/dac269451d8a4e65032c7b10b9ebbd34.mp4?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE EVERYTHING</h2><br>Skydome is totally free to play. But if you want to prove that you're not only a Tower Defense master, but also a fashion genius, there are a huge variety of icons, banners, walls and Champions skins available for purchase.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/4a1fab3705bc44c910675b92256b8d98.poster.avif?t=1684347717\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/4a1fab3705bc44c910675b92256b8d98.webm?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708550/extras/4a1fab3705bc44c910675b92256b8d98.mp4?t=1684347717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUARDIANS OF THE ARENA</h2><br>Play with over 10 Champions of 4 different classes, each one with a unique specialty to help in the defense of your Artifact.",
